        "title": "Reinungh David namdaih khou tei",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Reinungh David namdaih khou tei",
            "Guaihkai raan dingbam khuan e,",
            "Kapui rui Kanah zibam khang",
            "Guaihkuak lung khou zilou e;",
            "Kachangh thaimeipui Mary e,",
            "Kanah Jisu Khrista e.",
            "2. Kamei tingkau thang rui kei e,",
            "Kamei meiguai Raguang e,",
            "Kamei duppui bam guaih kai e,",
            "Kazibam tei guaih kuak ge;",
            "Lung simei panti khou lung e,",
            "‘Niu ta kalloumei Pu e",
            "2. Kamei alau khou rui thauna",
            "Lat piumei na sukhuan e,",
            "Zianthaimei lungh niamhmei kapui",
            "Baanpuam rui na pamlou e,",
            "Khristian alau nun guai rui ni",
            "Kakum lat piu nina e.",
            "",
            "3. Aniu alau kumna Jisu,",
            "Tingmik thuih daithau khuan e;",
            "Suanmei, thiammei, alau suna",
            "Kapmei, nuihmei, thai khuan e;",
            "Aniu rianra neihla gan khou,",
            "Kamei rui phungchamhlou e.",
            "",
            "4. Nzianna thuakloupui paan rui,",
            "Khampui nung Kalun hou ni;",
            "Nzaengmei zianmei ngana hei",
            "Aniu tingkau Raguang e;",
            "Kamei tatpui chaengluan khou tei",
            "Kanah nun ta zailou e."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
